# File Organization Rules

- One module per domain: `database`, `users`, `masters` (aggregator), `auth` (future), `camera` (future)
- **Masters**: folder per master (`masters/roles/`, `masters/vehicles/`) — routes `masters/<name>`; `MastersModule` only imports/exports children; **users stay in `modules/users/`**
- **Entities** → `modules/database/entity/`
- **DAO implementations** → `modules/database/dao/`
- **DAO interfaces** → `modules/<feature>/dao/*.interface.ts`
- **Services** → `modules/<feature>/service/`
